  m_text: <b >Congratulations!</b><size=12 >/n</size>You won a Flood Plain<size=12
    >/n</size>Floods can be very destructive but they also deposit a lot of sediment
    which is very fertile.<size=12 >/n</size>Flood plains are great for farming.
